{"id":942194,"title":"14｜美团MTGR：HSTU算法落地经验","content":"美团MTGR论文对MetaHSTU算法进行了改进与落地，主要解决了三个问题：不建模统计特征、特征平铺导致存储和计算成本高、Causal Attention限制了协同过滤效果。针对这些问题，MTGR通过分桶量化实数特征并分配ID，使数值特征与类别特征对齐，统一管理；将多种特征拼接并通过MLP降维，减少存储消耗和计算量；引入单双向混合Attention机制，更好地建模历史行为共现关系。实验数据显示，MTGR在CTR和CTCVR上显著优于传统模型，并展示了Scaling Law效应。然而，在线实验表明小尺寸模型在线转化效果不明显，中型模型点击提升但转化不足，大型模型取得较好均衡收益。此外，离线与在线效果相关性弱，提示未来优化需考虑算力消耗及系统因素。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":405317,"user_name":"muni","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2061557,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"E14FD4E324A6BB","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1f/74/f5/542fb70d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1770945026,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":147665,"content":"每周更新的","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":4424762,"ctime":1770975386,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":405317,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101108201,"comment_content":"别停更啊","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4424762,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/43/84/3a/3d745603.jpg","nickname":"傅聪Cong","note":"","ucode":"83729C2BAD5684","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":678378,"discussion_content":"每周更新的","content_length":15,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1770975386,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":406697,"user_name":"Bank","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3580859,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"8EAA7C63DF9297","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/36/a3/bb/5cde4385.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1775704608,"is_pvip